 "title": "Metal Scrape",
 "category": "Effects",
 "text": "Sound: a grinding, screeching scrape of metal on metal, slowly dragging up and down: the harsh texture of industrial noise.\n\nHow it's built: white noise ring-modulated by a high saw, through the State-Variable filter's band-pass with high RESONANCE (a screech); a slow saw-shaped LFO drags the CUTOFF up and drops it; Drive and a Reverb.\n\nPlay: hold a key (its pitch sets the saw, the 'metal').\n\nTweak: the LFO's RATE and WAVE, RESONANCE, the ring mod's MIX.",
